    '          "x-description-en": "Code actions on a warning or hint of the last compiler run: \"Disable W1000 here\" puts {$WARN SYMBOL_DEPRECATED OFF} before and {$WARN SYMBOL_DEPRECATED ON} after the l' + 'ine, plus variants around the routine, for the whole unit and (after asking) for the whole project in the project options. Hints get {$HINTS OFF}/{$HINTS ON}, warnings without their own identifier {$W' + 'ARNINGS OFF}/{$WARNINGS ON} (affects all warnings). Flow messages such as H2164 or W1035 only around the whole routine. One undo step.",' + #10 + '          "x-issue": "#531"' + #10 + '        },' + #10 + '        "disableWarningReason": {' + #10 + '          "type": "boolean",' + #10 + '          "default": true,' + #10,
